  "title": "AI safety at scale with the MAI team",
  "description": "Shipping AI safely is an ongoing process of experimentation, investigation, creativity, and design. We’ll share how we've built safety systems for large-scale nondeterministic systems – making them robust to emerging harms and adversarial actors, and how we tackle trade-offs like over-refusal. Expect a discussion-driven session on building AI that’s flexible, reliable, and accountable.\n\nSeating for this session is first-come, first-served. Add it to your schedule to plan your day and arrive early to secure a spot.",
